<h3>Fun Stuff</h3>

<div class="info">
<h5>Trivia:</h5>
Constantine slits his wrists, starting with his left, and Lucifer reaches out to claim him with his left hand, in keeping with the traditional depiction of the left ("sinister") side being associated with evil.
<a class="tn15more inline" href="/title/tt0360486/trivia" onClick="(new Image()).src='/rg/title-tease/trivia/images/b.gif?link=/title/tt0360486/trivia';">more</a>
</div>

<div class="info">
<h5>Goofs:</h5>
Revealing mistakes: When Angela is looking at the video of Isabel's suicide, she rewinds it, but the button she pushes on the far left is not the "rewind/search" button on QuickTime Player, but instead the "return to beginning".
